        <li><strong>Review AI's response</strong> against the requirements checklist</li>
        <li><strong>Test with multiple arrays</strong> — empty, one item, many items</li>
        <li><strong>Verify the loop boundaries</strong> — does it start at 0? Does it use &lt; not &lt;=?</li>
        <li><strong>Refine if needed</strong> with follow-up prompts</li>
